WEBVTT

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.260
What exactly is artificial intelligence?

00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:11.426
We speak of AI when
computer systems perform

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.760
tasks that usually require
human intelligence.

00:00:14.761 --> 00:00:18.380
This includes, for example,
recognizing images,

00:00:18.404 --> 00:00:21.560
making decisions or
engaging in dialogue.

00:00:21.561 --> 00:00:26.460
To do this, the AI systems must be
equipped with knowledge and experience.

00:00:26.461 --> 00:00:30.200
This can be achieved in two ways.

00:00:30.201 --> 00:00:33.363
You can program each
individual instruction so

00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:36.480
that the machine solve
the task step by step.

00:00:36.481 --> 00:00:40.760
This is comparable to a cooking
recipe or assembly instructions.

00:00:40.761 --> 00:00:45.120
Alternatively, you can use programs
that learn from data themselves.

00:00:45.121 --> 00:00:48.780
This enables them to
detect relevant information,

00:00:48.804 --> 00:00:51.640
draw conclusions,
or make predictions.

00:00:51.641 --> 00:00:55.360
This is known as machine learning.

00:00:55.361 --> 00:00:59.280
We all have probably dealt
with AI at some point in our lives.

00:00:59.281 --> 00:01:01.877
When we watch films,
listen to music or shop

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:07.400
online, AI gives us recommendations
about what we might like.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:13.357
AI is capable of converting
spoken language into

00:01:13.381 --> 00:01:17.240
text and translating it
into other languages.

00:01:17.241 --> 00:01:20.520
AI is a central component of robotics.

00:01:20.521 --> 00:01:26.180
Robots make our everyday lives
easier, what a constrainuous activities.

00:01:26.181 --> 00:01:32.060
Self-driving vehicles recognize their
environment through AI and can react to it.

00:01:32.061 --> 00:01:35.920
AI is becoming increasingly
important within medicine.

00:01:35.921 --> 00:01:42.480
It supports doctors
when diagnosing diseases.

00:01:42.481 --> 00:01:48.160
Also more and more patients use
AI-based apps for initial diagnosis.

00:01:48.161 --> 00:01:50.646
In the educational
sector, AI helps to

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:55.960
individualize learning activities, for
example on digital learning platforms.

00:01:55.961 --> 00:01:59.520
AI is becoming increasingly important.

00:01:59.521 --> 00:02:02.288
Once we understand how
AI works, we can better

00:02:02.312 --> 00:02:05.092
gauge where it can
support everyday activities

00:02:05.093 --> 00:02:09.960
at home and at work, and where we
would rather make our own decisions.

00:02:09.961 --> 00:02:15.320
AI will not replace humans, but it is
getting better and better at supporting us.

00:02:15.321 --> 00:02:18.600
For this, we need an AI-competent society.